# SwiftData Thread Safety

All types that touch SwiftData **must** be `@MainActor`. Missing this causes malloc crashes ("pointer being freed was not allocated"). Apply to the class, mocks, and test classes. Reference: commit `c8c7076`.

```swift
// ❌ BAD — SwiftData off the main actor
final class PersonalProfileService {
    private let modelContext: ModelContext
}

// ✅ GOOD — class, mocks, and tests
@MainActor
final class PersonalProfileService {
    private let modelContext: ModelContext
}

@MainActor
final class PersonalProfileServiceTests: XCTestCase { }
```

Existing `@MainActor` services include `CalendarSyncService`, `EventKitService`, `GoogleCalendarSyncService`, `MicrosoftCalendarSyncService`, `ICSCalendarSyncService`, `RecurrenceEngine`, `RecurrenceExceptionManager`, `PersonalProfileService`.
